  (text "How to read this schematic\nEach box is a page. Wires end in name tags (labels): any two tags with the same name are connected,\neven on different pages. The symbols marked +5V, +5V_YM, +4V5A, +3V3, GND and GNDA are power connections.\nParts marked DNP are not fitted by PCBWay. Pages: Power > Controller > Sound chip > Audio out > Front panel." (at 30.48 140 0)
